{"slug":"Strait_of_Gibraltar","title":"Strait of Gibraltar","cats":[],"headings":[{"id":"Map_nations","text":"Nations","level":2},{"id":"Map_data","text":"Map data","level":2}],"html":"<p><i>Not to be confused with <a href=\"/Gateway_to_the_Atlantic\" title=\"Gateway to the Atlantic\">Gateway to the Atlantic</a></i>\n</p><p>Strait of Gibraltar is a <a href=\"/Maps\" title=\"Maps\">map</a> with a canal in the middle (naturally-made).\n</p><p>This <a href=\"/Maps\" title=\"Maps\">map</a> can be seen as a zoomed in version of <a href=\"/Gateway_to_the_Atlantic\" title=\"Gateway to the Atlantic\">Gateway to the Atlantic</a>.\n</p><p>[[&lt;Heightmap Missing&gt;|thumb|A map of Strait of Gibraltar.]]\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><img src=\"/images/Strait_of_Gibraltar_map.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"326\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"2902\" data-file-height=\"1477\"><figcaption>The Strait of Gibraltar map, from the <a href=\"https://github.com/openfrontio/OpenFrontIO/tree/main/map-generator/assets/maps/straitofgibraltar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenFront game files</a>.</figcaption></figure>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Map_nations\">Nations</h2></div>\n<p>The map features 16 named <a href=\"/Nations\" title=\"Nations\">nations</a>, including Algeria, Portugal, Shilha, Huelva, Cadiz and Malaga.</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Map_data\">Map data</h2></div>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Categories:</b> Europe, Africa</li>\n<li><b>Nations:</b> 16</li>\n<li><b>Public rotation frequency:</b> 5</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading1\"><h1 id=\"See_also\">See also</h1></div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/Maps\" title=\"Maps\">Maps</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Gateway_to_the_Atlantic\" title=\"Gateway to the Atlantic\">Gateway to the Atlantic</a></li></ul>","section":"Maps"}
